{% doc %}
  Whether the current page is a programme page (DS-51): one on the programme template, which puts
  the page text's opening before its card groups and its headed sections after them. Volunteer uses
  it too, for its role cards (DS-58). Prints true or false; capture it and compare with 'true'.

  Before release it knew the programme pages by their old template names too (L-08). The release
  gave each page its template on 2026-09-29, so the template is the only test.

  @example
  {%- capture programme_page -%}{% render 'gs-is-programme-page' %}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- if programme_page contains 'true' -%} ... {%- endif -%}
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign result = false
  if template.suffix == 'programme'
    assign result = true
  endif
  echo result
-%}
